{
  "description": "在已观察页面或容器内插入文字、公式、图形、表格、图表或填空。提供类型、正文及所需位置尺寸，可用 appearance 同次设置文字/公式/图形/表格/图表的初始专业外观，语义同 object.update；省略时保留人工插入默认，input 当前不支持 appearance。软件准备容器、专业数据和身份，正式事务可撤销。Flow destination=document 为正文，paper 为纸张浮层。",
  "inputSchema": {
    "$defs": {
      "__schema0": {
        "additionalProperties": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema1"
        },
        "propertyNames": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": "object"
      },
      "__schema1": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "type": "null"
          },
          {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          {
            "type": "number"
          },
          {
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema1"
            },
            "type": "array"
          },
          {
            "additionalProperties": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema1"
            },
            "propertyNames": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "type": "object"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "appearance": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema0",
        "description": "可选初始专业外观，和 object.update 的 appearance 同义；只覆盖提供字段，省略时保留人工插入默认。文字/公式支持 fontSize、color、bold、lineHeight、shadows 等；图形、表格、图表使用其公开专业 style 字段，图形使用 fillColor、borderColor 等实际字段。input 当前不支持 appearance。"
      },
      "center": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "x": {
            "type": "number"
          },
          "y": {
            "type": "number"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "x",
          "y"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "chartType": {
        "enum": [
          "bar",
          "line",
          "area",
          "pie",
          "donut"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "destination": {
        "enum": [
          "document",
          "paper"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "height": {
        "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
        "type": "number"
      },
      "index": {
        "maximum": 9007199254740991,
        "minimum": 0,
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "kind": {
        "enum": [
          "text",
          "formula",
          "shape",
          "table",
          "chart",
          "input"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "shapeType": {
        "enum": [
          "rectangle",
          "rounded-rectangle",
          "ellipse",
          "triangle",
          "diamond",
          "line",
          "arrow-left",
          "arrow-right",
          "arrow-up",
          "arrow-down",
          "arrow-left-right",
          "elbow-arrow",
          "brace-left",
          "brace-right",
          "brace-top",
          "brace-bottom",
          "brace-pair-horizontal",
          "brace-pair-vertical",
          "bracket-left",
          "bracket-right",
          "emphasis-dot",
          "emphasis-triangle"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "target": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "text": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "width": {
        "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
        "type": "number"
      },
      "x": {
        "type": "number"
      },
      "y": {
        "type": "number"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "target",
      "kind"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "静态目录只说明已登记接口；当前运行是否可调用、文档范围、写权限、短句柄和服务配置，以宿主本轮发现与实际回执为准。",
  "manual": {
    "group": "edit",
    "label": "插入专业元素",
    "targetKinds": [
      "course-surface",
      "course-instance"
    ]
  },
  "name": "object.insert",
  "version": 1
}
